int-identity","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2010.15526","retrievedAt":"2026-11-16","sourceType":"preprint-identity"}],"limitations":["这是定向补采的三个候选，不是对全领域的小众方向穷尽排名；补采论文不加入占比分母。","证据充分表示达到当前规则门槛；不等于研究质量已获人工评审、数据已下载复现，或每年都持续维护。","These are factual primary-source observations for one candidate topic. No sufficient/pending decision, quality score, or LLM-generated abstract is present.","Four listed papers are distinct works. arXiv and journal versions share workId/relatedDoi and must not be counted twice.","Publication date bases differ: the NiftyMIC journal issue date, FeTA journal date, FeTA2022 first preprint submission and 2025 version-of-record date are explicitly identified.","FeTA has one exact-day observed release plus a month-only second-version statement. A second same-dataset release at least 365 days later has not been verified.","FeTA Biometry 2024 is a separate, explicitly derived annotation dataset. Combining its date with the FeTA image dataset as if both were consecutive versions would overstate longitudinal MRI data accumulation.","The official FeTA2024 site says Zurich images are unchanged from 2021/2022. A challenge's year, a record modification date, and a different metadata URL are not automatically evidence of new data.","FeTA original paper distinguishes a 50-subject study from 40 released labeled reconstructions; no original release participant count is inferred from the abstract alone.","Dataset access is restricted; only public records were inspected. No restricted clinical images were downloaded and file-level content changes were not independently checked.","NiftyMIC latest observed default-branch commit is in February 2022; SVRTK core latest is in April 2025. Recent maintenance belongs specifically to auto-proc-svrtk.","Auto-proc-svrtk has observed brain-script changes across 2023, 2024 and 2026; this is sampled commit evidence, not a complete maintenance audit or validation of clinical performance.","The 2025 scanner study explicitly states its individual MRI datasets are not publicly available; that cohort is not counted as an open data release.","The candidate groups related reconstruction and segmentation infrastructure; topical relationship alone does not establish that every paper uses every dataset or repository."]}]}
